,{"location":"markdown/#links-and-images","title":"Links and images","text":"<pre><code>[Link text](https://example.com)\n[Link with title](https://example.com \"Hover title\")\n![Alt text](image.jpg)\n![Image with title](image.jpg \"Image title\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#lists","title":"Lists","text":"<pre><code>Unordered:\n- Item 1\n- Item 2\n  - Nested item\n\nOrdered:\n1. First item\n2. Second item\n3. Third item\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#blockquotes","title":"Blockquotes","text":"<pre><code>&gt; This is a blockquote\n&gt; Multiple lines\n&gt;&gt; Nested quote\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#code-blocks","title":"Code blocks","text":"<pre><code>```javascript\nfunction hello() {\n  console.log(\"Hello, world!\");\n}\n```\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#tables","title":"Tables","text":"<pre><code>| Header 1 | Header 2 | Header 3 |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| Row 1    | Data     | Data     |\n| Row 2    | Data     | Data     |\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#horizontal-rule","title":"Horizontal rule","text":"<pre><code>---\nor\n***\nor\n___\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#task-lists","title":"Task lists","text":"<pre><code>- [x] Completed task\n- [ ] Incomplete task\n- [ ] Another task\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#escaping-characters","title":"Escaping characters","text":"<pre><code>Use backslash to escape: \\* \\_ \\# \\`\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"markdown/#line-breaks","title":"Line breaks","text":"<pre><code>End a line with two spaces  \nto create a line break.\n\nOr use a blank line for a new paragraph.\n</code></pre>"}]}